│          S  split                                        │
│          i  squash interactively                         │
│      Enter  diff the revision                            │
│      Alt+d  diff any two revisions                       │
│          a  abandon                                      │
│          A  absorb                                       │
│          D  duplicate                                    │
│          r  rebase the revision                          │
│          R  rebase it and its descendants                │
│          l  files in the revision                        │
│          c  resolve the conflict                         │
│          b  bookmarks                                    │
│          f  fetch                                        │
│          P  push the revision's bookmarks                │
│          o  op log                                       │
